      "verdict": "supported",
      "strength": 0.9,
      "reason": "Q4 shows 2024-12-21 trips (131279) fall within the range of other December Saturdays (88213 to 159150). The baseline average is 131087, so 131279 is nearly identical. This supports H3: the trip count is consistent with typical Saturday seasonality; 2024-12-21 is not an outlier."
    },
